graph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/03201de6aa1efc8ba76dd346170a698d.poster.avif?t=1792040039\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/03201de6aa1efc8ba76dd346170a698d.webm?t=1792040039\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/03201de6aa1efc8ba76dd346170a698d.mp4?t=1792040039\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌱 Endless Planter — every growth cycle is a surprise<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tiny world that never repeats itself.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every plant growth cycle:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌱 Random plant shapes<br>🌱 Different growth paths<br>🌱 Endless fruit to collect<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You never know what you will grow next.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place a little life on your desktop and watch it slowly grow.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/3efdd7814fa6e01cdde148fcce7c17fd.poster.avif?t=1792040039\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/3efdd7814fa6e01cdde148fcce7c17fd.webm?t=1792040039\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/3efdd7814fa6e01cdde148fcce7c17fd.mp4?t=1792040039\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎁 Gacha Machine × Pet-Girl Collection<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect new desktop friends!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gacha machine can give you:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💕 Adorable pet girls<br>👾 Curious little monsters<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These little friends live near the Windows taskbar:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam freely<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run around<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep you company while you use your PC<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colorful cast is waiting to be collected.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own little desktop ecosystem.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/eb88a6d79b667f4babacc1b4e09e7364.poster.avif?t=1792040039\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/eb88a6d79b667f4babacc1b4e09e7364.webm?t=1792040039\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/eb88a6d79b667f4babacc1b4e09e7364.mp4?t=1792040039\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/4b70e41d099528466ad31b70d626b1b5.poster.avif?t=1792040039\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/4b70e41d099528466ad31b70d626b1b5.webm?t=1792040039\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/4b70e41d099528466ad31b70d626b1b5.mp4?t=1792040039\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎵 A more soothing desktop atmosphere<\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ambient Sound Player<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from immersive soundscapes such as:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rain<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forest<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cafe<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nature sounds and more<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your desktop into a small space to unwind.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/d4f5dbd21a6f15c62e28c4c4059488be.poster.avif?t=1792040039\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/d4f5dbd21a6f15c62e28c4c4059488be.webm?t=1792040039\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/d4f5dbd21a6f15c62e28c4c4059488be.mp4?t=1792040039\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lofi Music Player<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎧 80 handpicked Lofi tracks<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reading<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give your PC an atmosphere of its own.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/8d3a086383903d0d69e76f31800ff134.poster.avif?t=1792040039\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/8d3a086383903d0d69e76f31800ff134.webm?t=1792040039\"