ss=\"bb_tag\" >📄 Document Tools<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Word to PDF<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PDF to Word<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View and clean file metadata<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hash checks<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔐 Security Tools<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Password generator<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Text encryption<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hash verification<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/4f36ec533d8cf1b841ecdae935cbb948.poster.avif?t=1792040039\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/4f36ec533d8cf1b841ecdae935cbb948.webm?t=1792040039\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/4f36ec533d8cf1b841ecdae935cbb948.mp4?t=1792040039\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✍️ Text Tools<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Word and character count<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simplified\/Traditional Chinese conversion<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chinese-to-Pinyin conversion<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special character library<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Number-base conversion<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morse code conversion<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌟 Life Journal<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own digital space:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My Habits (check-in tracker)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My Journal<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ASCII art generator<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decision wheel<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/3a6839d8ab054f36c3bba6d0b7106530.poster.avif?t=1792040039\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/3a6839d8ab054f36c3bba6d0b7106530.webm?t=1792040039\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/3a6839d8ab054f36c3bba6d0b7106530.mp4?t=1792040039\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/b600f68ad0a175515a3ef13a5e0dd4b8.poster.avif?t=1792040039\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/b600f68ad0a175515a3ef13a5e0dd4b8.webm?t=1792040039\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/b600f68ad0a175515a3ef13a5e0dd4b8.mp4?t=1792040039\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/505b3238fbf141dbe29331c7acf2baa1.poster.avif?t=1792040039\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/505b3238fbf141dbe29331c7acf2baa1.webm?t=1792040039\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/505b3238fbf141dbe29331c7acf2baa1.mp4?t=1792040039\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💖 She will always be there on your desktop<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A computer is more than a machine.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It can feel warm and personal.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When work wears you out, she helps you unwind.<br>When you need to focus, she helps you plan.<br>When boredom strikes, she brings new collections and surprises.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is your desktop companion.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your productivity assistant.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And a digital partner who is truly yours.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎉 Major update: “Your Fiancée – AI Companion Expansion DLC” is now available for free!<\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >《Your Fiancée》<\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your personal desktop companion, by your side every day<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is more than ordinary software.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is an elegant, mature companion who lives on your desktop—<br>there while you work, study, or unwind, and ready to help organize daily life.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize her appearance and outfits freely to make her a truly one-of-a-kind desktop companion.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From hardware monitoring, task planning, and money management to pet collecting, music, and desktop decoration...<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She will become the most special presence on your PC.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨ Create your own elegant companion<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She has a distinctive charm that is elegant, mature, and alluring.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize her:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Hair color<br>◆ Eye color<br>◆ Earrings<br>◆ Many other appearance details<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich outfit system is included too:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👗 Mix and match a wide range of signature outfits<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try a different style every day and keep your desktop feeling fresh.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/4eebe6b2e613afd478e64961a93ed012.poster.avif?t=1792040039\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/4eebe6b2e613afd478e64961a93ed012.webm?t=1792040039\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/4eebe6b2e613afd478e64961a93ed012.mp4?t=1792040039\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🖥️ Powerful hardware monitoring<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is not only good company; she is also your PC assistant.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between two hardware-monitoring layouts:<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simple Mode<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ideal for everyday use:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CPU usage<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GPU usage<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memory status<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Temperature monitoring<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive status<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Network status<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how your PC is running at a glance.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/96d6e944d797aecaf1b481eeac09093b.poster.avif?t=1792040039\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/96d6e944d797aecaf1b481eeac09093b.webm?t=1792040039\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/96d6e944d797aecaf1b481eeac09093b.mp4?t=1792040039\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Advanced Hardware Monitoring<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for power users.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View more detailed data:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed CPU information<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time GPU status<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Video memory usage<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core clock speeds<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Temperature graphs<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power consumption<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >System status analysis<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your desktop companion into a professional PC monitoring tool.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/96c8e91271c39a6f8b0d87feab39e07d.poster.avif?t=1792040039\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/96c8e91271c39a6f8b0d87feab39e07d.webm?t=1792040039\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/96c8e91271c39a6f8b0d87feab39e07d.mp4?t=1792040039\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌟 Steam Workshop — Expand Your Desktop World Without Limits<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your desktop companion can be so much more.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>Steam Workshop<\/strong>, explore a wealth of content created by players around the world:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎀 A huge collection of anime-style characters<br>🎀 Personalized desktop-pet designs<br>🎀 Unique outfits and styles<br>🎀 Original player creations<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply subscribe to add a favorite character to your desktop and keep your desktop world feeling alive and new.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨ Subscribe to characters you love<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Workshop, you can:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Browse character creations shared by other players<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subscribe to a favorite desktop pet with one click<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download and apply it to the game automatically<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch your desktop companion whenever you like<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new character may be waiting every day.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your desktop never has to look the same twice.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/创意工坊_safe02?t=1792040039\" \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎨 Create your own desktop companion<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If inspiration strikes, you can become a creator too.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes a convenient <strong>Steam Workshop upload tool<\/strong>:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upload characters you have made and share them with players around the world.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique character designs<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalized desktop pets<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original anime-style characters<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A desktop companion of your own<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your creations to desktops around the world.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/e97de781035d0b102a77ba05e660b58f.avif?t=1792040039\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras_big\/e97de781035d0b102a77ba05e660b58f.webp?t=1792040039 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/mod工具02?t=1792040039\" \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/ef2c5f8139c5d62a57fac09f60d45ef8.avif?t=1792040039\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras_big\/ef2c5f8139c5d62a57fac09f60d45ef8.webp?t=1792040039 width=1560 height=853 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/c6180fe43e194d49c7d82c3ec294c88c.avif?t=1792040039\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras_big\/c6180fe43e194d49c7d82c3ec294c88c.webp?t=1792040039 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⏰ A little helper for better productivity<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She helps you manage your time and get more out of every day.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🍅 Pomodoro Timer<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the classic Pomodoro method:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus → Take a timed break → Stay at your best<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a steadier rhythm for work and study.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/f185ba0e234eea8485c3d24dc03aba7f.poster.avif?t=1792040039\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/f185ba0e234eea8485c3d24dc03aba7f.webm?t=1792040039\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/f185ba0e234eea8485c3d24dc03aba7f.mp4?t=1792040039\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔔 Smart Reminders<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set reminders for anything you do not want to forget:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work reminders<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study plans<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Important dates<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyday tasks<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She will remind you when the time is right.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/363708de9ba578440dac0ed14d9ae9b9.poster.avif?t=1792040039\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/363708de9ba578440dac0ed14d9ae9b9.webm?t=1792040039\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/363708de9ba578440dac0ed14d9ae9b9.mp4?t=1792040039\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🖼️ Image Motion Workshop<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your pictures to life.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Import any image<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint the areas you want to move<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust motion settings<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easily create:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ Animated wallpaper effects<br>✨ Live2D-style image effects<br>✨ Fun desktop decorations<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/8ff5b3e743cbc08064fa10fc3a7ca259.poster.avif?t=1792040039\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/8ff5b3e743cbc08064fa10fc3a7ca259.webm?t=1792040039\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/8ff5b3e743cbc08064fa10fc3a7ca259.mp4?t=1792040039\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✅ To-Do List<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complete task-management system:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create tasks<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize by category<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your tasks<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track completed tasks<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep each day's goals organized.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/5e737f255ccbfac2a54cedde0daba578.poster.avif?t=1792040039\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/5e737f255ccbfac2a54cedde0daba578.webm?t=1792040039\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/5e737f255ccbfac2a54cedde0daba578.mp4?t=1792040039\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💰 Easy Expense Tracker<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your everyday finances.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Record:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily spending<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Income and expenses<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spending categories<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Financial planning<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See clearly where every bit of your money goes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/03201de6aa1efc8ba76dd346170a698d.poster.avif?t=1792040039\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/03201de6aa1efc8ba76dd346170a698d.webm?t=1792040039\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/03201de6aa1efc8ba76dd346170a698d.mp4?t=1792040039\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌱 Endless Planter — every growth cycle is a surprise<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tiny world that never repeats itself.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every plant growth cycle:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌱 Random plant shapes<br>🌱 Different growth paths<br>🌱 Endless fruit to collect<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You never know what you will grow next.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place a little life on your desktop and watch it slowly grow.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4753760\/extras\/3efdd7814fa6e01cdde148fcce7c17fd.poster.avif?t=1792040039\" width=1170 height=